function toggleDef(code,on){let e=expedientes.find(x=>x.id===currentMotor);if(!e)return;if(on&&!e.defectIds.includes(code))e.defectIds.push(code);if(!on)e.defectIds=e.defectIds.filter(x=>x!==code);updateDecision(e);persist();renderCatalog();renderCloseSelect();renderTable()}
